            "review_title": "Review at The Hermit Cocktail Bar",
            "review_text": "Gerry T\nMinneapolis, Minnesota50 contributions\n1\nNot to be missed — Outstanding\nJan 2024 • Friends\nThis was a highlight of our trip to Ho Chi Minh City. We kept going back every night. Try Vietnamese gin - delicious and unusual. Gin and Tonic - so refreshing. Connor the owner spoke perfect English and curated the cocktails better than anyone I’ve experienced- very descriptive of flavor profiles. Fun atmosphere- relaxed - hard to find.\nValue\nService\nAtmosphere\nWritten January 22, 2024\nThe Hermit Cocktail Bar\nThank you for your review, it was a pleasure for us to host you. We hope to see you again whenever you visit HCM city.\nWritten January 24, 2024\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
